  "description": {
    "de": "This study deals with copepod and amphipod crustaceans collected during year 2018 (received in 2020) and year 2020 (received in 2021). In 2019 a single sample was collected. Sixteen species were found; the number of specimens identified amounts to 1,414 in 23 samples (566 for 2018 and 848 for 2020). Additionally, some specimens were juveniles (copepodids) of harpacticoid copepods, which cannot be identified (110 specimens, 67 in 2018, 43 in 2020).\n"
  },
